                                "sense_id": "8bd49a80-d08f-3eac-88e3-0ef19a075e37",
                                "text": "De beslissing had gewichtige gevolgen voor het bedrijf.",
                                "translation": "The decision had important consequences for the company.",
                                "english": "The decision had important consequences for the company."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6954366b-5738-4c8d-a957-9c754ace0f1c",
                                "sense_id": "8bd49a80-d08f-3eac-88e3-0ef19a075e37",
                                "text": "De president hield een gewichtige toespraak over het belang van milieubescherming.",
                                "translation": "The president delivered an important speech about the importance of environmental protection.",
